      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "2. The I.A. has been filed for releasing the petitioner on interim bail for a period of one month as his father-Banka Sahu has expired on 07.11.2023 and as the petitioner is the only son, his release is necessary to perform the obsequies of his father.",
