      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "3. When the case was listed yesterday i.e. 16.11.2023, Mr. D.K. Mishra, learned Additional Government Advocate had been directed to obtain instructions through the IIC, Kodala Police Station regarding the date of death of Banka Sahu, the father of the petitioner and if the petitioner is the only son.\n4.",
