    "ANALYSIS": "As the petitioner is accused of committing offences under Sections 363, 376 (AB), 506 of IPC read with Section 4 of POCSO Act and is not the only son of late Banka Sahu, I am not inclined to release him on interim bail to perform the obsequies of his father.\n",
